insert into questions (external_key, question_type, question_text, instructions, media, correct_answer, score_config, difficulty, category, tags, time_limit_seconds, required) values ('spatial-q5', ('pattern_question')::question_type, '3x3 grid, medium difficulty (category: Inner Pattern). Each row has a fixed large outer shape/color (row 1 = indigo square, row 2 = amber circle, row 3 = green diamond) containing a small white inner shape that changes per cell. The bottom-right cell is blank. The correct completion keeps the row 3 green diamond outer shape and uses a matching white diamond as the inner shape.', 'Track the outer shape/color per row and the changing inner shape per cell, then pick the option that completes the missing cell.', ('[]')::jsonb, NULL, ('[]')::jsonb, ('medium')::assessment_difficulty, 'spatial-intelligence', '{}'::text[], NULL, true)
